---
import SFSymbol from './SFSymbol.astro';
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="relative px-4 sm:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 bg-[#ffffff] text-[#1d1d1f]"
>
  <div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto">
    <!-- Apple Eyebrow -->
    <div class="reveal-item flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <SFSymbol name="compass" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#0071e3]" />
      <span class="apple-eyebrow text-[#0071e3]">02 — Philosophy & Purpose</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Apple Editorial Headline -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-6">
      <h2 class="reveal-item apple-headline-section text-[#1d1d1f] tracking-tight mb-3" style="transition-delay: 80ms;">
        A website should do more than look good.
      </h2>

      <p class="reveal-item text-[16px] sm:text-[18px] font-normal leading-[1.3] tracking-tight text-[#1d1d1f] mb-3" style="transition-delay: 160ms;">
        It should communicate clearly, guide users naturally, perform effortlessly and create meaningful value for the business behind it.
      </p>

      <p class="reveal-item apple-body-medium text-[#86868b] max-w-2xl text-[14px] sm:text-[15px]" style="transition-delay: 220ms;">
        We view digital platforms as high-precision engineering products. Every interaction, typographic hierarchy, and line of code is designed to eliminate ambiguity and respect user intent.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Apple Value Pillars (3 Cards) -->
    <div class="reveal-item grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-6 border-t border-[#d2d2d7]" style="transition-delay: 280ms;">
      <div class="apple-card-light p-4">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#d2d2d7] flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 text-[#0071e3]">
          <SFSymbol name="sparkles" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-1 tracking-tight">Intentional Design</h3>
        <p class="apple-body-small text-[#86868b] text-[13px] leading-relaxed">
          Form follows function. Typographic clarity leads to interfaces that feel immediately natural.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="apple-card-light p-4">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#d2d2d7] flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 text-[#0071e3]">
          <SFSymbol name="cpu" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-1 tracking-tight">Technical Precision</h3>
        <p class="apple-body-small text-[#86868b] text-[13px] leading-relaxed">
          Built on modern web standards with zero bloat, robust accessibility, and sub-second loading.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="apple-card-light p-4">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#d2d2d7] flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 text-[#0071e3]">
          <SFSymbol name="chart.line" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] mb-1 tracking-tight">Measurable Impact</h3>
        <p class="apple-body-small text-[#86868b] text-[13px] leading-relaxed">
          Digital experiences engineered to guide users towards decisive actions and lasting outcomes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
